<title>MALTA: Malta hotel share issue sees strong interest.</title>
<headline>Malta hotel share issue sees strong interest.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares and bonds in Malta's biggest hotel, Suncrest Hotels plc, went on sale to the public on Monday after strong interest by stockbrokers, who were entitled to sell half the issue in an early offer.</p>
</text>
